name rosario
category Package
revision 51688
shortdesc Using the free Rosario fonts with LaTeX
longdesc The package provides the files required to use the Rosario
longdesc fonts with LaTeX. Rosario is a set of four fonts provided by
longdesc Hector Gatti, Adobe Typekit & Omnibus-Type Team under the Open
longdesc Font License (OFL), version 1.1. The fonts are copyright (c)
longdesc 2012-2015, Omnibus-Type.
execute addMap Rosario.map
